<% content_for :title, "AWSM and other archive tools" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Compare AWSM with archive, browser capture, read-later, and bookmark tools. Choose the archive that fits your work." %>
<% content_for :body_class, "public-site" %>

<%= render "shared/public_header" %>

<main class="site-container compare-page">
  <header class="compare-page__header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Compare tools</p>
    <h1>Choose the archive that fits your work.</h1>
    <p class="compare-page__lede">AWSM is one kind of archive. These guides explain where other tools are stronger, where AWSM is different, and which boundary matters for the work you want to do.</p>
  </header>

  <aside class="compare-current" aria-labelledby="compare-current-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Current release</p>
    <h2 id="compare-current-title">AWSM today</h2>
    <p>AWSM currently includes a browser extension and a Desktop Runtime for Vault management. The browser captures pages; the desktop app manages Vaults through the same <%= glossary_term_link "Local-First", "local-first" %> encrypted <%= glossary_term_link "Vault", "Vaults" %> boundary. Release <%= link_to "v#{public_product_links[:current_release_version]}", public_product_links[:current_release], class: "term-link" %> can optionally synchronize opaque data through a <%= glossary_term_link "Hosted Replica" %>. It has no mobile Client, hosted web reader, user-facing AI, or server-side crawler.</p>
    <p class="compare-current__note">This page describes the current release. It is not a promise about an unreleased feature.</p>
  </aside>

  <div class="compare-categories">
    <% @comparison_categories.each do |category| %>
      <section class="compare-category" aria-labelledby="category-<%= category.title.parameterize %>">
        <header class="compare-category__header">
          <p class="eyebrow"><%= category.title %></p>
          <h2 id="category-<%= category.title.parameterize %>"><%= category.description %></h2>
        </header>
        <div class="compare-card-grid">
          <% @comparisons.select { |comparison| comparison.category == category.title }.each do |comparison| %>
            <article class="compare-card">
              <p class="compare-badge"><%= comparison.badge %></p>
              <h3><%= comparison.name %></h3>
              <p><%= comparison.description %></p>
              <%= link_to "Read AWSM and #{comparison.name}", comparison_path(comparison.slug), class: "compare-card__link" %>
            </article>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </section>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <p class="compare-disclosure"><strong>No affiliation:</strong> AWSM is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the products named here. Product capabilities change. Each guide links to the alternative's official sources and shows when it was reviewed.</p>
</main>

<%= render "shared/public_footer" %>
